cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wickra-genome"
abstract: >-
  A vector database of the whole market built on the Wickra core: every asset
  is embedded as a live feature vector whose axes a data-driven GenomeSpec
  names, drawn from the 497 O(1) streaming indicators the shared registry
  resolves by name. Over the cross-section of embedded assets it answers
  similarity (k nearest neighbours), clustering (seeded k-means) and anomaly
  (nearest-neighbour outlier scores), exposed as a JSON-over-C-ABI data API in
  ten languages.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: kingchenc
    website: "https://wickra.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wickra-lib/wickra-genome"
url: "https://wickra.org"
license:
